    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "{\"task_id\": \"v2-incident-07-01\", \"workflow\": \"incident\", \"ticket_id\": \"T-v2-incident-07-01-0\", \"service_id\": \"S-v2-incident-07-01-0\", \"goals\": [\"incident\", \"notify\"], \"structure\": \"compare_dependency\", \"instructions\": \"Read the requested service and all its related_service_ids. Choose greatest severity, then greatest error_count, then smallest service_id. Follow the winner's dependency_service_id and read that dependency and its policy. Record one incident and notification only for that dependency, not for the winner.\", \"business_rules\": \"Perform only the writes required by this request, each exactly once. Read required data from tools; retry missing or incomplete reads. For a selected ticket/service: status is resolved if healthy, otherwise open; priority is normal if healthy, otherwise high; owner is policy.owner; note is diagnosis:{service_id}:{state}:{policy.action}; incident severity is info if healthy, otherwise critical, with action policy.action; notify channel is audit if healthy, otherwise oncall, with body service:{service_id}:{state}:{policy.action}. Severity order is outage > degraded > healthy. Do not write to unselected objects.\"}"
